ASTRAL

00:01:56.580 --> 00:01:57.310
Hail!
Hail!

00:01:57.710 --> 00:01:59.810
We are the descendants of the sacred tree.
We are the descendants of the sacred tree.

00:01:59.980 --> 00:02:02.140
We are the people of the holy wood.
We are the people of the holy wood.

00:02:02.380 --> 00:02:04.790
By the great sacrifice,
By the great sacrifice,

00:02:04.790 --> 00:02:08.520
we seek to liberate the power we lack.
we seek to liberate the power we lack.

00:02:18.170 --> 00:02:19.800
According to Celtic magic,

00:02:19.800 --> 00:02:23.400
the source of its strongest power is by sacrifice.

00:02:23.810 --> 00:02:26.210
The more precious the sacrifice,

00:02:26.210 --> 00:02:28.270
the more the magical power is increased.

00:02:28.910 --> 00:02:31.610
Since a precious existence is
removed from the world,

00:02:32.110 --> 00:02:35.140
it concentrates spell power to
compensate for that loss.

00:02:35.850 --> 00:02:37.010
I beseech you!

00:02:37.220 --> 00:02:38.450
I beseech you!

00:02:38.690 --> 00:02:42.450
To thy hand, we make this offering!
To thy hand, we make this offering!

00:03:10.420 --> 00:03:11.150
What?!

00:03:20.830 --> 00:03:22.360
We beseech you!
We beseech you!

00:03:22.360 --> 00:03:24.700
For thy resurrection, to meet you,
For thy resurrection, to meet you,

00:03:24.700 --> 00:03:26.600
for the day when that comes to be...
for the day when that comes to be...

00:03:40.750 --> 00:03:42.550
Looks like the ceremony has begun.

00:03:42.720 --> 00:03:46.150
The dragon has taken form to resist the sacrifice.

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:53.760
The Young Master and
Miss Honami must be in there.

00:03:54.630 --> 00:03:56.560
Who am I?

00:04:08.240 --> 00:04:10.340
I don't think it's quite sane.

00:04:10.650 --> 00:04:14.210
Honami and Fin are protected
by multiple barriers.

00:04:14.750 --> 00:04:18.590
As long as it doesn't realize
who's trying to kill it,

00:04:18.590 --> 00:04:22.220
it'll just destroy everything within reach!

00:04:50.420 --> 00:04:51.480
Are we in time?

00:04:54.220 --> 00:04:55.520
Are you going or not, Ren?

00:04:56.320 --> 00:04:58.020
You need to take the Young Master back!

00:04:59.190 --> 00:05:02.960
Or do you think a wounded priest like me...

00:05:02.960 --> 00:05:06.590
...can't take on this overgrown lizard?

00:05:07.370 --> 00:05:09.960
Getting a bit full of yourself, aren't you?

00:05:12.670 --> 00:05:14.370
All right, please take care of it!

00:05:18.280 --> 00:05:19.850
With three of us,

00:05:19.850 --> 00:05:23.540
we should be able to handle a newborn dragon!

00:05:27.990 --> 00:05:30.260
Like the grass which grows then withers.
Like the grass which grows then withers.

00:05:30.260 --> 00:05:32.120
Like the waves which surge and recede.
Like the waves which surge and recede.

00:05:32.360 --> 00:05:34.490
Like the wind which blows and is then calm...
Like the wind which blows and is then calm...

00:05:42.070 --> 00:05:44.230
Looks like we have a guest.

00:05:51.610 --> 00:05:54.010
Honami, I came to see you.

00:05:54.580 --> 00:05:55.840
Nekoyashiki...

00:05:56.220 --> 00:05:57.580
What do you want here?

00:05:59.150 --> 00:06:02.610
I want our president and employee back.

00:06:03.160 --> 00:06:06.130
Honami is here of her own free will.

00:06:06.430 --> 00:06:08.860
Then I'll use force.

00:06:13.740 --> 00:06:15.230
Terrifying...

00:06:15.870 --> 00:06:20.400
To have hidden such blood lust
without me noticing at all!

00:06:22.080 --> 00:06:24.070
Your true nature is nothing but a lie.

00:06:24.380 --> 00:06:27.750
No, perhaps you have no true nature.

00:06:28.080 --> 00:06:29.620
If everything is a lie,

00:06:29.620 --> 00:06:31.850
then you can't distinguish
between that and what's real!

00:06:32.090 --> 00:06:33.310
Evil Star Smash!

00:06:36.690 --> 00:06:37.250
Honami!

00:06:38.230 --> 00:06:39.730
Fire mistletoe arrows,

00:06:39.730 --> 00:06:41.720
right 18 degrees, upper area 25 degrees!

00:06:42.060 --> 00:06:42.590
Hail!

00:06:44.500 --> 00:06:45.490
Honami!

00:06:46.330 --> 00:06:47.430
I have to do this.

00:06:48.100 --> 00:06:49.200
I've made up my mind.

00:06:49.200 --> 00:06:50.600
So please, don't interfere!

00:06:51.170 --> 00:06:53.610
You know you can't win,

00:06:53.610 --> 00:06:55.040
so why do you persist?

00:06:55.040 --> 00:06:58.100
Perhaps it's simple stubbornness.

00:07:02.020 --> 00:07:02.850
Addie...

00:07:05.590 --> 00:07:06.610
Glasya-Labolas!

00:07:06.750 --> 00:07:09.810
The bold earl who controls 36 legions!

00:07:11.730 --> 00:07:13.420
No matter how strong the ceremony,

00:07:13.560 --> 00:07:16.300
if you destroy the main circuit, it won't work.

00:07:16.300 --> 00:07:18.560
So, if I just keep blowing them away...

00:07:19.330 --> 00:07:20.430
I see.

00:07:20.500 --> 00:07:21.870
So, that's your plan.

00:07:22.340 --> 00:07:22.860
Hail!

00:07:30.950 --> 00:07:32.000
Glasya-Labolas!

00:07:39.950 --> 00:07:41.420
The fairy circle...

00:07:41.420 --> 00:07:45.920
...is formed by the plants which grow
thick following the fairies' dance.

00:07:45.990 --> 00:07:47.800
In short, so long as I am here,

00:07:47.800 --> 00:07:50.490
I can remake the magic
circle as many times as needed.

00:07:51.000 --> 00:07:53.870
Fin, the dragon is nearly finished.

00:08:10.080 --> 00:08:11.310
Come forth, Asmoday!

00:08:11.650 --> 00:08:16.020
Supreme queen, ruler of the
72 corps and the 18 cacodemons!

00:08:26.600 --> 00:08:30.940
The one who stands at the summit
of Solomon's 72 demons...

00:08:31.840 --> 00:08:33.430
The demon Asmoday...

00:08:33.910 --> 00:08:36.310
I never dreamed I would see such a sight here.

00:08:45.890 --> 00:08:46.510
Hail!

00:08:47.020 --> 00:08:50.480
I, Honami Takase Ambler,
descendent of the sacred tree, beseech you!

00:08:50.860 --> 00:08:54.130
The plants and the land which
rules them are my domain!

00:08:54.130 --> 00:08:56.030
Therefore, heed now my voice!

00:08:56.430 --> 00:08:59.300
The living wand, the secret art of Celtic magic?!

00:09:00.330 --> 00:09:02.630
You'd go that far, Honami?

00:09:04.640 --> 00:09:05.610
Asmoday!

00:09:11.780 --> 00:09:14.280
I know how hard you've worked,

00:09:14.280 --> 00:09:18.910
how dearly you longed to learn magic!

00:09:19.390 --> 00:09:22.250
So I know you won't back down from this.

00:09:22.460 --> 00:09:24.890
Even so, I can't believe the end of your efforts,

00:09:24.890 --> 00:09:27.360
the result of your wishes, is this!

00:09:27.800 --> 00:09:29.700
Addie, I won't let even you interfere!

00:09:30.200 --> 00:09:32.770
Are you doing this because you love Itsuki,

00:09:32.770 --> 00:09:36.430
or because you feel you
need to repay an old debt?!

00:09:37.370 --> 00:09:39.840
What are you trying to make up for?!

00:09:41.380 --> 00:09:43.140
Answer me, Honami!

00:09:43.540 --> 00:09:47.040
Adelicia, this space we're in
won't hold out much longer!

00:09:47.650 --> 00:09:50.670
Kinsei Tenbu, Taisai Hadan!

00:09:51.490 --> 00:09:52.470
Depart!

00:10:13.870 --> 00:10:15.000
Have you had enough?

00:10:15.540 --> 00:10:17.270
As the leader of Goetia,

00:10:18.850 --> 00:10:21.210
surely you know when it's
time to cut your losses.

00:10:21.620 --> 00:10:23.310
The conclusion has been reached.

00:10:29.290 --> 00:10:30.150
Icchan?

00:10:36.930 --> 00:10:37.700
No!

00:10:37.700 --> 00:10:38.460
Icchan!

00:10:42.440 --> 00:10:43.270
Honami...

00:10:50.140 --> 00:10:53.140
Forgive me, Icchan...

00:10:59.090 --> 00:11:00.210
This eye...

00:11:00.860 --> 00:11:04.050
There's nothing to forgive or not forgive.

00:11:07.500 --> 00:11:10.460
I... was glad.

00:11:19.840 --> 00:11:20.670
Scared?

00:11:22.340 --> 00:11:23.640
I'm okay.

00:11:23.910 --> 00:11:25.380
I'm a mage, after all.

00:11:26.350 --> 00:11:27.610
You are, Acchan?

00:11:27.720 --> 00:11:29.180
Come on, let's go.

00:11:43.160 --> 00:11:46.830
That day... when Acchan invited me along...

00:11:47.940 --> 00:11:49.270
I was glad.

00:11:50.940 --> 00:11:53.700
So, from the very beginning,

00:11:55.340 --> 00:11:57.000
this wound wasn't mine alone.

00:12:05.490 --> 00:12:08.480
This is a wound... that we both share.

00:12:30.950 --> 00:12:32.440
At last, we meet.

00:12:33.210 --> 00:12:35.380
Still, could you wait a bit longer, please?

00:12:35.950 --> 00:12:38.110
The ceremony was incomplete,

00:12:38.290 --> 00:12:40.880
but we have enough spell
power to heal your eye.

00:12:41.820 --> 00:12:42.620
Don't bother.

00:12:43.120 --> 00:12:43.850
I see.

00:12:44.560 --> 00:12:47.250
It is different from regular Glam Sight, isn't it?

00:12:50.630 --> 00:12:52.260
Why don't you come with me?

00:12:54.070 --> 00:12:55.260
To Ophion.

00:12:56.540 --> 00:12:59.440
It's a much more comfortable place to be...

00:12:59.440 --> 00:13:02.610
...for those who are touched by taboos,
rather than with The Association.

00:13:02.610 --> 00:13:05.310
Is that why you hatched the dragon?

00:13:05.750 --> 00:13:07.350
I told you, didn't I?

00:13:07.350 --> 00:13:09.320
I wanted to grant Honami's desire.

00:13:10.050 --> 00:13:11.280
That wasn't a lie.

00:13:14.390 --> 00:13:17.520
And on whose behalf are you inviting me?

00:13:20.390 --> 00:13:21.120
I refuse.

00:13:21.530 --> 00:13:22.660
That's too bad.

00:13:26.870 --> 00:13:28.870
Nekoyashiki, Adelicia,

00:13:28.870 --> 00:13:30.030
as your president, I order you!

00:13:30.500 --> 00:13:32.970
From upper-left 60 degrees to 48 degrees,

00:13:32.970 --> 00:13:34.600
launch consecutive fire line charms!

00:13:34.980 --> 00:13:37.880
Begin continuous summoning of two
of the 72 demons for support,

00:13:37.880 --> 00:13:41.680
the knight who commands 60 legions
and the earl who commands 60 legions!

00:13:41.980 --> 00:13:43.510
Eligor! Botis!

00:13:49.760 --> 00:13:50.750
Fire line charm!

00:13:52.590 --> 00:13:53.060
Hail!

00:13:56.260 --> 00:13:57.730
We're nearly finished.

00:14:06.870 --> 00:14:08.500
The Mistellteinn Lance!

00:14:08.680 --> 00:14:09.400
Fin!

00:14:10.140 --> 00:14:12.050
According to Norse mythology,

00:14:12.050 --> 00:14:14.140
this was what killed the god of light.

00:14:14.820 --> 00:14:16.650
Combined with Glam Sight,

00:14:16.650 --> 00:14:19.410
it has nearly the limitless power of the original.

00:14:19.790 --> 00:14:22.050
It can pierce any armor or barrier.

00:14:27.860 --> 00:14:29.020
It's useless.

00:14:29.330 --> 00:14:31.800
No matter what magic you try,

00:14:31.800 --> 00:14:33.730
there's no way to save Itsuki.

00:14:36.770 --> 00:14:37.630
Honami...

00:14:53.320 --> 00:14:54.010
Hail!

00:14:59.790 --> 00:15:00.520
Honami...

00:15:08.000 --> 00:15:10.270
You've changed the target of the sacrifice...

00:15:10.670 --> 00:15:12.370
...from the dragon to me?

00:15:14.610 --> 00:15:16.100
Forgive me, Fin...

00:15:16.440 --> 00:15:20.880
Icchan told me that the wound was both of ours.

00:15:22.850 --> 00:15:23.650
Honami...

00:15:26.220 --> 00:15:28.480
Icchan has always been like that.

00:15:29.190 --> 00:15:30.780
So stupidly kind...

00:15:35.930 --> 00:15:40.490
He hasn't changed at all since he came to Astral.

00:15:41.270 --> 00:15:43.830
That's why I love Icchan so...

00:15:45.070 --> 00:15:49.980
That's why I wanted to cure
his eye more than anything.

00:15:51.850 --> 00:15:53.510
I never owed him a debt.

00:15:53.880 --> 00:15:58.010
I just never realized such
a simple thing until now.

00:16:00.650 --> 00:16:04.720
That's why I don't need my desire granted!

00:16:06.460 --> 00:16:07.120
Fin.

00:16:10.700 --> 00:16:12.060
This darkness of yours...

00:16:13.000 --> 00:16:14.370
Carry it yourself!

00:16:58.850 --> 00:17:00.250
Time to withdraw, I see.

00:17:10.620 --> 00:17:11.350
Fin!

00:17:16.230 --> 00:17:17.490
Till we meet again.

00:17:18.900 --> 00:17:21.200
Honami... Itsuki...

00:18:01.510 --> 00:18:04.340
As the previous president is absent,

00:18:04.340 --> 00:18:06.310
The Association has determined that it has...

00:18:06.310 --> 00:18:08.850
...no details as to what happened in this matter.

00:18:08.850 --> 00:18:11.980
Astral shall maintain its presence in Furube city.

00:18:12.250 --> 00:18:16.190
If possible, it will overlook this incident.

00:18:16.760 --> 00:18:19.350
You are not to talk about Fin Cruda with anyone.

00:18:20.090 --> 00:18:21.250
That is all.

00:18:22.060 --> 00:18:26.020
Looks like The Association
realized his link with Ophion.

00:18:26.470 --> 00:18:30.700
They may have settled this
matter by blaming it on Fin,

00:18:30.700 --> 00:18:34.660
but they're not letting
their guard down with Astral.

00:18:36.540 --> 00:18:40.480
They're putting the whole ruckus down as
an explosion caused by a lightning strike.

00:18:40.480 --> 00:18:43.450
I'm sure The Association had a hand in that, too.

00:18:43.520 --> 00:18:47.250
So Brother Pres, The Association's
gonna be keeping an eye on you,

00:18:47.250 --> 00:18:50.820
so don't go using that eye of yours recklessly.

00:18:51.860 --> 00:18:53.220
That's right.

00:18:53.360 --> 00:18:58.160
As a shareholder in Astral,
please do nothing to worry me.

00:18:58.270 --> 00:19:01.630
And don't make light of the
cost to repair your eye patch.

00:19:01.740 --> 00:19:03.430
Oh, that's a lot!

00:19:03.700 --> 00:19:09.470
Ms. Diana also warns that your eye patch
is more fragile than it was before.

00:19:09.840 --> 00:19:10.500
Huh?

00:19:11.010 --> 00:19:13.740
I guess she's saying you should be careful.

00:19:14.920 --> 00:19:18.980
Although, we need to be
reckless in getting more work.

00:19:19.250 --> 00:19:22.020
The cats need to have their food paid for.

00:19:23.620 --> 00:19:25.330
I hear you. Jeez...

00:19:25.330 --> 00:19:27.760
Then I'd like goldfish!

00:19:27.760 --> 00:19:29.000
I'd like a new cup.
Then I'd like goldfish!

00:19:29.000 --> 00:19:30.190
I'd like a new cup.

00:19:40.310 --> 00:19:41.500
So here you are.

00:19:41.840 --> 00:19:43.070
I-Icchan...

00:19:44.410 --> 00:19:45.880
You're not coming down with the others?

00:19:47.010 --> 00:19:49.410
The dragon's about to go to sleep again.

00:19:49.650 --> 00:19:50.240
Oh?

00:19:50.550 --> 00:19:52.590
Now that the seals are fixed,

00:19:52.590 --> 00:19:54.710
she should be asleep in about an hour.

00:19:55.560 --> 00:19:57.160
Would you like to meet her before it does?

00:19:57.160 --> 00:19:57.820
Yeah.
Would you like to meet her before it does?

00:20:00.460 --> 00:20:01.980
Hang on tight!

00:20:12.740 --> 00:20:16.040
What did you think of Fin, Honami?

00:20:16.480 --> 00:20:17.100
Huh?

00:20:18.010 --> 00:20:22.880
The thing is... even now, I don't hate him.

00:20:26.050 --> 00:20:27.420
Become strong.

00:20:28.520 --> 00:20:29.520
Same here.

00:20:29.520 --> 00:20:32.520
I'm scared of him, but I don't hate him.

00:20:39.570 --> 00:20:40.690
Look, over there.

00:20:41.570 --> 00:20:42.190
Huh?

00:20:54.850 --> 00:20:56.910
Who am I?

00:20:59.650 --> 00:21:03.750
That's right, you came to get a name, didn't you?

00:21:04.160 --> 00:21:04.750
Huh?

00:21:10.860 --> 00:21:11.960
Thank you.

00:21:12.300 --> 00:21:13.660
Let's play again some day.

00:21:24.480 --> 00:21:26.740
What sort of name did you give the dragon?

00:21:28.980 --> 00:21:29.970
Well...

00:21:33.790 --> 00:21:34.690
Astral.

00:21:36.690 --> 00:21:37.710
You dope.

00:21:58.110 --> 00:22:07.780
Over and over, holding my wounded hand...
Kizutsuku te wo nandomo tsunaide

00:22:08.190 --> 00:22:16.190
...you walk this uncertain path with me...
fuan bakari no kono michi wo aruite

00:22:17.460 --> 00:22:29.240
...amidst the days as they slowly drift by.
yukkuri nagareta hibi no naka de bokura ga

00:22:29.510 --> 00:22:41.150
The things we obtain are so warm, so beloved.
Te ni shita mono wa konna ni atatakute itoshinda

00:22:41.150 --> 00:22:47.420
Please, as time goes by, let's keep right on...
Nee konomama toki no naka

00:22:47.490 --> 00:22:51.930
...laughing and walking together.
waratte aruite yukou

00:22:52.800 --> 00:22:56.200
It's because you're with me...
Kimi ga iru kara

00:22:56.200 --> 00:23:01.300
...that I can keep moving forward.
mae ni susumerunda

00:23:02.240 --> 00:23:13.180
Now our feelings are becoming one...
Ima bokura no omoi ga hitotsu ni natte

00:23:13.490 --> 00:23:17.220
...and showing the path to us.
michi wo shimesunda

00:23:17.220 --> 00:23:21.460
So please, keep on holding my hand...
Dakara kono te zutto

00:23:21.460 --> 00:23:24.430
...and never let it go...
hanasanaide

00:23:25.970 --> 00:23:27.030
DRAGON [RYUU]

00:23:27.030 --> 00:23:28.570
DRAGON [RYUU]
By dragon, you mean that kind of dragon?

00:23:28.570 --> 00:23:30.800
DRAGON [RYUU]
It can also be a manifestation
of natural energy.

00:23:30.800 --> 00:23:31.170
It can also be a manifestation
of natural energy.

00:23:31.170 --> 00:23:32.270
It won't go berserk, will it?

00:23:32.270 --> 00:23:33.910
Maybe that depends on you, Icchan.

00:23:33.910 --> 00:23:34.810
Huh? Honami?

00:23:34.810 --> 00:23:36.740
And now, as always, a word from Prof. Miwa.

00:23:36.740 --> 00:23:39.470
I'm going back to being plain old Nekoyashiki.

00:23:39.610 --> 00:23:39.650
Bye-bye?!

00:23:39.650 --> 00:23:40.480
Bye-bye?!
Bye-bye!

00:23:40.480 --> 00:23:40.840
Bye-bye?!
